# Domain Model — MRGym

The Domain Model represents the conceptual business entities and relationships of the MRGym mobile application.

```mermaid
classDiagram
    direction LR

    class User {
        email
        password
        name
    }

    class WorkoutPlan {
        name
    }

    class Exercise {
        id
        name
        description
    }

    class WorkoutLog {
        date
        durationMinutes
    }

    User "1" --> "0..*" WorkoutPlan : creates
    User "1" --> "0..*" WorkoutLog : logs
    WorkoutPlan "1" --> "1..*" Exercise : contains
    WorkoutLog "0..*" --> "1" WorkoutPlan : references
```

## Entity Descriptions

- **User**: Represents a gym user account registered in the system with credentials and profile information.
- **WorkoutPlan**: Represents a training routine composed of one or more exercises.
- **Exercise**: Represents an exercise movement with an identifier, name, and description.
- **WorkoutLog**: Represents a completed workout session with timestamp and elapsed duration.
